    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi list!<br><br>I have a 3D array with only binary data (0s and 1s). I want to do computations at each 1 where I would compute the sum around that point over a certain surface and in multiple directions (vertically and laterally). My code produces what I expect, but is very long, even in parallel (~2 h on 6 cores with my smallest data array). I&#39;ve given a toy example, but my arrays are usually bigger than 200 * 400 * 1000 (~8e7, with about 20% 1s, so 1.6e6 values from which to compute.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">toto </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">round</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">^</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>xyz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">air </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>dims </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>halfPath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ncores </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> detectCores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>splitArray </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mclapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">splitIndices</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xyz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">air</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ncores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#000\">lapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> xyz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">air</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Produce a sequence over which to get the data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    seqRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dims</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    seqCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dims</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    seqSlc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dims</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> halfPath</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Get the total length of the vector</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dimRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dimCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqCol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dimSlc </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#Compute the sum in multiple directions divided by the area over which it is computed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    verticalLong </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dimRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dimSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    verticalWide </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dimRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dimCol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    lateralLong  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dimCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dimSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    cube </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seqRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seqSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dimRow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dimCol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dimSlc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verticalLong</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> verticalWide</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lateralLong</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cube</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cores </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ncores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Thank you for any advice on speeding up the code!<br><br>Guillaume<br></div>"
    ]
