     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Thursday, March 3, 2016 at 12:01:51 PM UTC-8, Guillaume Théroux Rancourt wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi list!<br><br>I have a 3D array with only binary data (0s and 1s). I want to do computations at each 1 where I would compute the sum around that point over a certain surface and in multiple directions (vertically and laterally). My code produces what I expect, but is very long, even in parallel (~2 h on 6 cores with my smallest data array). I&#39;ve given a toy example, but my arrays are usually bigger than 200 * 400 * 1000 (~8e7, with about 20% 1s, so 1.6e6 values from which to compute.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">toto </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> array</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">round</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">^</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">200</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>xyz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">air </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>dims </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toto</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>halfPath </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ncores </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> detectCores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>splitArray </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mclapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">splitIndices</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xyz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">air</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ncores</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#000\">lapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx</span><span style=\"color: